      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 SeedVR2 (Down)Load DiT Model\n\n### Models are downloaded automatically the first time you use them.\n### Check the SeedVR2 Note. \n### The files are saved in: ComfyUI\\models\\SEEDVR2\n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- **ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler**\n- **rgthree-comfy**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n"
      ],
